        "body_raw": "Duskwalker."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "Once per day, if you are reduced below 0 hit points as a result of an attack or ability used by another character, as an immediate action you can take a single standard action. You must use this action to attack or harm the creature that damaged you. At 11th level, you can use this feat a second time per day."
      }
